1. WHAT IS ALLOWED (and only this)

   a) Reading and examining the source code in this repository, for
      personal or professional evaluation (for example, by someone
      reviewing an application or a partnership with the owner).
   b) Doing what the GitHub Terms of Service already allow any GitHub
      user to do with a public repository (view it and fork it through
      GitHub's own functionality), strictly within the limits of that
      functionality. That right comes from the GitHub Terms of Service,
      is not an additional license granted by this file, and does not
      authorize anything beyond what those terms say.
   c) Uses that Brazilian law guarantees without the owner's permission
      and that cannot be waived by contract, such as partial quotation
      of the program for teaching purposes, identifying the program and
      the owner (Art. 6, II, Brazilian Law 9,609/1998).

2. WHAT IS PROHIBITED WITHOUT PRIOR, EXPRESS, WRITTEN PERMISSION

   Everything else. In particular, you may not: run, install or deploy
   the Software or any part of it, for any purpose (commercial,
   personal, academic, testing or internal); copy, reproduce or
   redistribute it; modify, adapt or create derivative works;
   sublicense, sell, rent or offer it as a service; remove ownership
   notices; use the code, or parts of it, to train, fine-tune or
   evaluate artificial intelligence models, or to build a competing
   product or service; reverse engineer it in order to reproduce it;
   or scrape this repository in bulk by automated means.

3. NO OTHER LICENSE

   Nothing in this repository, its history, its documentation or the
   fact of its publication grants any license to use, any patent
   license, any trademark license or any other right, by implication or
   otherwise. Use of the Software requires the owner's prior and
   express authorization (Art. 29, Brazilian Law 9,610/1998) and a
   license agreement (Art. 9, Brazilian Law 9,609/1998). To request
   permission, contact the owner at contato@praxedes.xyz.

4. DATA AND MARKS

   Names, logos, characters and visual identity found in this
   repository (including "Estrelinha", "Estrelinho", "PraxedesIA" and
   "Praxedes") are not licensed. People and companies appearing in
   examples or tests are fictitious or merely illustrative.

5. INFRINGEMENT

   Use outside what Section 1 allows infringes the owner's copyright
   and exposes the infringer to the applicable civil and criminal
   remedies.

6. NO WARRANTY

   The Software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. To
   the fullest extent permitted by law, the owner is not liable for
   any damages arising from reading or otherwise using the Software.

7. VENUE

   Brazilian law applies. The courts of the District of Ji-Paraná,
   State of Rondônia, are chosen as venue, except where the law makes
   other venue rules mandatory.
